# PUHON Gaming Clan Website - Environment Variables

# Member Password
# Password for family members to access the dashboard
# Default: puhon2024 (for development only)
MEMBER_PASSWORD=puhon2024

# Admin Password
# Password for admins to access the admin panel
# Default: puhonAdmin2024 (for development only)
ADMIN_PASSWORD=puhonAdmin2024

# Production Notes:
# - Set strong, unique passwords in production
# - Use Vercel environment variables for deployment
# - Never commit actual .env file with real passwords